message: "If you use IMD Data Puller in your work, please cite it as below, and also cite the IMD datasets (see the references)."
type: software
title: "IMD Data Puller: a web app for India Meteorological Department gridded rainfall and temperature for points, areas and catchments"
authors:
  - family-names: Madival
    given-names: Harshit Prakash
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-19
