license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hpmadival/imd-data-puller"
abstract: >-
  IMD Data Puller is a free web app that downloads India Meteorological
  Department (IMD) daily gridded rainfall (0.25 degree, from 1901) and
  maximum and minimum temperature (1 degree, from 1951) for points, boxes,
  drawn outlines or uploaded catchment boundaries. It computes area-weighted
  catchment averages with data-coverage checks, Hargreaves potential
  evaporation, monthly and yearly summaries, rainfall indices and
  Mann-Kendall / Sen's slope trends, and exports CSV, Excel and NetCDF files.
keywords:
  - India Meteorological Department
  - IMD gridded data
  - rainfall
  - temperature
  - hydrology
  - catchment
  - Streamlit
